Hard group: B also leads,
20% versus 10% for A.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Pooled: A 82.7%, B 32.5%.
A has more easy trials; B has more hard trials.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:44,000
With equal group weights:
A 50%, B 57.5%.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Compare the groups and their weights
before judging the overall rate.
